      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET CLARICE (1) missed the frame latest when eighth at this track (30.58) but was a winner three back in the second best time of the program. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. The form out of last race has been strong. Can atone. GIDEON MONELLI (4) was strongly fancied last time but finished fifth (30.24) at this track, bringing a seven-run winning streak to an end. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from five starts. Key player if finds best. ICONIC GUESS (7) is a promising dog in the frame at 22 of 51 starts including 16 wins and was a last start winner (29.75) over 520m at this track. Looks suited and expected to run well. HURRY UP ERIC (5) did a good job to finish third last time out over 520m at this track (30.07) in a OPEN, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
